referrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:03741961-7b25-4a12-9a9c-c8c7cc7d98bc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dizby\" title=\"Dizby\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Dizby.png/25px-Portrait_Dizby.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Dizby.png/38px-Portrait_Dizby.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Dizby.png/50px-Portrait_Dizby.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dizby\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Portrait_Dizby.png/25px-Portrait_Dizby.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Portrait_Dizby.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dizby\" title=\"Dizby\">Dizby</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Lustrous_Lass\" title=\"Lustrous Lass\">Lustrous Lass</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#Counting_House_docks\" title=\"The Counting House\">Counting House docks</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-183&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-226</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I told <a href=\"/wiki/Jorkens\" title=\"Jorkens\">Jorkens</a>, 'Jorkens', I said, 'the captain should never have dropped anchor at Crone Island', but Jorkens just laughed at me, like he always does. Now I ain't seen the captain in days, just stays in her cabin and calls out through her door, saying she's sick, and I'm feeling mighty poorly myself.\n</p><p><br>\nJorkens don't look so good neither. But at least he's stopped laughing at me.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_Own_Deal\" title=\"My Own Deal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/My_Own_Deal\" title=\"My Own Deal\">My Own Deal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lustrous_Lass\" title=\"The Lustrous Lass\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></